  "title": "Jared NDE 6234",
  "date": "1980",
  "content": "I was 13 years old when I passed. I am an epileptic and I was swimming in a pool. I had a Grand Mal seizure in the pool, drowned, and was clinically dead for a few minutes. I also went into a 4-day coma after that time. I do remember my Near Death Experience. It was very simple. I remember seeing me lying at the bottom of the pool and I begin to hover or float. My mother was screaming. Someone jumped into the pool and pulled me out. Then it was like a sudden rush of something pushed me back into body and that was it. It was nothing fancy.",
